00:21:02,950 --> 00:21:06,710
This is one of the most essential professional skills you can develop.

438
00:21:06,710 --> 00:21:11,550
Whether you're starting a new job, attending your first team meeting, meeting clients, joining

439
00:21:11,550 --> 00:21:16,910
a video conference, or networking at a corporate event, your introduction matters.

440
00:21:16,910 --> 00:21:21,710
Absolutely, the way you introduce yourself influences how people perceive you.

441
00:21:21,710 --> 00:21:27,110
It affects your credibility, your professional image, and even future opportunities.

442
00:21:27,110 --> 00:21:32,150
is such an important word. It means people trust your competence and professionalism.

